{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國聯邦調查局（FBI）拘捕人工智能巨擘OpenAI沙特阿拉伯裔前工程師阿爾福贊（Abdulrahman Alfozan），指控他在公司會議室安裝隱蔽錄音裝置企圖竊聽。</p><p>《紐約郵報》引述法庭文件顯示，疑犯是在計劃乘搭回國單程航班前3日落網。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:20:43.057180+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:44:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T16:37:40.485481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:17:40.256493+00:00","content_hash":"68ae3f4f09794a9b9f94cad2fb12ea430d05e22b245bb8735bfa7e013ea0c831","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}